sequenceDiagram
	participant Client as Commerce MFE\n(Next.js 16)
	participant GW as API Gateway\n(YARP)
	participant Ord as Ordering API\n(.NET 11 + Marten/PG)
	participant Bsk as Basket API\n(.NET 11 + Redis)
	participant Cat as Catalog API\n(.NET 11 + PG)
	participant Fin as Finance\n(Durable Functions)
	participant Notif as Notification\n(Kafka + MailKit)

	Client ->> GW: HTTPS POST /ordering/api/v1/orders (x-request-id)
	GW ->> Ord: Forward POST /api/v1/orders (Entra ID JWT)
	Ord ->> Bsk: gRPC basket.v1.BasketGrpcService/GetBasket
	Bsk -->> Ord: Persisted item quantities
	Ord ->> Cat: gRPC book.v1.BookGrpcService/GetBooks
	Cat -->> Ord: Authoritative book details & prices
	Ord ->> Ord: Persist Order snapshot + Marten event + PG outbox
	Ord -->> Client: 201 Created (orderId)
	Ord ->> Fin: Kafka: UserCheckedOutIntegrationEvent (key: OrderId)
	Fin ->> Fin: Start OrderOrchestrator in finance-taskhub
	Fin ->> Bsk: Kafka: PlaceOrderCommand (key: OrderId)
	Fin ->> Notif: Kafka: PlaceOrderCommand (key: OrderId)
	Notif ->> Notif: Redis 24h idempotency -> MJML -> MailKit SMTP
	Bsk ->> Bsk: Delete basket in Redis
	Bsk ->> Fin: Kafka: BasketDeletedComplete / FailedIntegrationEvent
	Fin ->> Ord: Kafka: DeleteBasketComplete / FailedCommand
